<DocsExample TExample="TabViewBasicExample" Title="Basic tabs" Description="Each NTTab is a panel with a header Label; selecting a tab shows its content. UpdateQueryString is off so these examples do not change the page URL, and each tab view has a unique Id." />
<DocsExample TExample="TabViewIconsBadgesExample" Title="Icons and badges" Description="Icon adds a leading icon to the tab header, and ShowBadge with BadgeContent and BadgeAriaLabel adds a count." />
<DocsExample TExample="TabViewVariantsExample" Title="Variants and layout" Description="Variant=Secondary uses the lighter style, FullWidth stretches tabs across the view, and Compact reduces height." />
<DocsExample TExample="TabViewSelectedExample" Title="Initial and disabled tabs" Description="SelectedValue chooses the initially selected tab by its Value, and Disabled prevents selecting a tab." />
<DocsExample TExample="TabViewPopoutExample" Title="Popout tabs" Description="Popout tabs open in a floating window and return to their original position when the window closes." />
